## 🔄 **Process Documentation Patterns**

### **Deployment Process**
```markdown
# Deployment Process

## Pre-Deployment Checklist
- [ ] All tests passing
- [ ] Code review completed
- [ ] Security scan passed
- [ ] Performance tests passed
- [ ] Documentation updated
- [ ] Database migrations tested
- [ ] Rollback plan prepared

## Deployment Steps
1. **Backup Database**
   ```bash
   mysqldump -u username -p database_name > backup.sql
   ```

2. **Deploy Code**
   ```bash
   git pull origin main
   composer install --no-dev
   npm run build
   ```

3. **Run Migrations**
   ```bash
   php artisan migrate
   ```

4. **Clear Caches**
   ```bash
   php artisan cache:clear
   php artisan config:clear
   php artisan view:clear
   ```

5. **Verify Deployment**
   - Check application health
   - Verify key functionality
   - Monitor error logs

## Post-Deployment
- [ ] Monitor application metrics
- [ ] Check error logs
- [ ] Verify user functionality
- [ ] Update documentation
- [ ] Notify stakeholders
```

### **Code Review Process**
```markdown
# Code Review Process

## Review Checklist

### Security
- [ ] Input validation implemented
- [ ] Output encoding applied
- [ ] Authentication checks present
- [ ] Authorization verified
- [ ] No sensitive data exposed

### Code Quality
- [ ] Follows coding standards
- [ ] No code duplication
- [ ] Proper error handling
- [ ] Clear variable names
- [ ] Adequate comments

### Testing
- [ ] Unit tests written
- [ ] Integration tests added
- [ ] Test coverage adequate
- [ ] Edge cases covered

### Performance
- [ ] No performance regressions
- [ ] Database queries optimized
- [ ] Caching implemented where appropriate
- [ ] No memory leaks

### Documentation
- [ ] Code documented
- [ ] API documentation updated
- [ ] README updated if needed
- [ ] Changelog updated
```

## 📈 **Metrics and Monitoring Documentation**

### **Performance Metrics**
```markdown
# Performance Metrics

## Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
- **Response Time**: < 200ms for 95% of requests
- **Throughput**: > 1000 requests per second
- **Error Rate**: < 0.1% of requests
- **Uptime**: > 99.9%

## Monitoring Setup
- **Application Monitoring**: [Tool name and configuration]
- **Database Monitoring**: [Database performance metrics]
- **Infrastructure Monitoring**: [Server and network metrics]
- **User Experience Monitoring**: [Real user monitoring]

## Alerting Thresholds
- **Critical**: Response time > 1s, Error rate > 1%
- **Warning**: Response time > 500ms, Error rate > 0.5%
- **Info**: Response time > 200ms, Error rate > 0.1%

## Performance Optimization
- **Database**: Query optimization, indexing strategy
- **Caching**: Redis configuration, cache invalidation
- **CDN**: Content delivery optimization
- **Code**: Algorithm optimization, memory usage
```

## 🎯 **Usage Guidelines**

### **When to Use These Patterns**
- Creating new documentation
- Updating existing documentation
- Standardizing documentation across projects
- Onboarding new team members
- Maintaining consistency in technical writing

### **Customization Tips**
- Adapt templates to your specific needs
- Add company-specific sections
- Include relevant examples from your codebase
- Maintain consistent formatting and structure
- Regular review and updates based on feedback